<p>From <span class="etyl"><a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_English" title="w:Middle English">Middle English</a></span> <i class="Latn mention" lang="enm"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Middle_English">interest</a></i>, from <span class="etyl"><a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_French" title="w:Old French">Old French</a></span> <i class="Latn mention" lang="fro"><a href="/wiki/interesse#Old_French" title="interesse">interesse</a></i> and <i class="Latn mention" lang="fro"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Old_French">interest</a></i> (<span class="etyl"><a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_language" title="w:French language">French</a></span> <i class="Latn mention" lang="fr"><a href="/wiki/int%C3%A9r%C3%AAt#French" title="intérêt">intérêt</a></i>), from <span class="etyl"><a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medieval_Latin" title="w:Medieval Latin">Medieval Latin</a></span> <i class="Latn mention" lang="la"><a href="/wiki/intersum#Latin" title="intersum">interesse</a></i>, from <span class="etyl"><a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latin" title="w:Latin">Latin</a></span> <i class="Latn mention" lang="la"><a href="/wiki/intersum#Latin" title="intersum">interesse</a></i>.
</p>
